{"availability":"available","full":"amap-cvlab/ABot-Recon","name":"ABot-Recon","description":"Streaming 3D reconstruction from only video input: Revisiting Local Context for Long-Horizon Streaming 3D Reconstruction","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":1379,"forks":74,"created":"2026-08-27T08:32:09Z","updated":"2026-10-16T10:02:07Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://amap-cvlab.github.io/ABot-Recon-html/","topics":["3d-reconstruction","abot-recon","slam"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/acvlab/abot-recon-streaming-3d","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T18:02:23.877Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T18:02:23.877Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T18:02:23.877Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T04:29:17.765Z","stars":1288,"forks":70},{"at":"2026-10-15T13:02:01.931Z","stars":1376,"forks":74},{"at":"2026-10-16T18:02:23.877Z","stars":1379,"forks":74}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["In one sentence: ABot-Recon reconstructs long video streams with a fixed 12-frame local context, composing current-frame geometry and adjacent relative poses into a global reconstruction without persistent learned long-range memory.","Long-horizon streaming reconstruction is often approached by adding increasingly elaborate mechanisms for retaining and fusing long-range state. ABot-Recon takes a deliberately local route. At each time step, it solves the same bounded prediction problem:","This design keeps model-state memory and per-frame computation independent of the elapsed sequence length. A lightweight motion-visual rotation refiner and composition-aware pose loss are used to limit drift when local poses are composed over long horizons."],"features":["cache KV features from the preceding 11 frames;","predict a point map $Pi$ in the current camera coordinate system;","estimate the adjacent relative pose $T{i-1\\leftarrow i}$; and","recover the global trajectory and point cloud through sequential pose composition."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/amap-cvlab/ABot-Recon/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"939b8efb414dc92807bb8c12db0ae4772a4a34fcdadae5bb28de76bd74a38811","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:02.019Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T18:02:23.979Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"In one sentence: ABot-Recon reconstructs long video streams with a fixed 12-frame local context, composing current-frame geometry and adjacent relative poses into a global reconstruction without persistent learned long-range memory.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/amap-cvlab/ABot-Recon/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"939b8efb414dc92807bb8c12db0ae4772a4a34fcdadae5bb28de76bd74a38811","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/amap-cvlab/ABot-Recon/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T18:02:23.979Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-16T10:02:07Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/amap-cvlab/ABot-Recon/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T20:36:55.203Z","hash":"939b8efb414dc92807bb8c12db0ae4772a4a34fcdadae5bb28de76bd74a38811","originalBytes":12452,"storedBytes":12452,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T18:02:23.877Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T04:30:03.395Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:30:03.395Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/77ee53a5cca9831963f3b99d.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-16T18:25:32.597Z","url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/acvlab/abot-recon-streaming-3d"}],"subjects":["Streaming","3D & graphics"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Other","subjects":["Streaming","3D & graphics"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Streaming","source":"metadata","match":"Streaming"},{"subject":"3D & graphics","source":"metadata","match":"3D"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Maths & algorithms"],"reviewRequired"